false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/testcontainers/testcontainers-java/pulls/5265","html_url":"https://github.com/testcontainers/testcontainers-java/pull/5265","diff_url":"https://github.com/testcontainers/testcontainers-java/pull/5265.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/testcontainers/testcontainers-java/pull/5265.patch","merged_at":"2022-05-08T08:02:27Z"},"body":"The current check throws an exception if the version is supposed to be\r\ngreater than 8 and the ca cert file is missing. This posed two problems:\r\n\r\n1. A custom docker image might have a 'latest' version, and thus is\r\n   newer than version 8\r\n2. A user may have configured their own CA in a different path\r\n\r\nIn order to accomodate for this, a missing copy of a the ca crt file\r\nwill log a warning, but not throw an exception and leave the container\r\nunstarted. There is also another public method, allowing to read the\r\ncert, called `extractCert`.\r\n\r\nCloses #5264","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/testcontainers/testcontainers-java/issues/5265/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/testcontainers/testcontainers-java/issues/5265/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":6432113566,"node_id":"LE_lADOAgP_mc5Hv5OXzwAAAAF_YkOe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/testcontainers/testcontainers-java/issues/events/6432113566","actor":{"login":"kiview","id":5088104,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwODgxMDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5088104?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiview","html_url":"https://github.com/kiview","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiview/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiview/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiview/gist